'''Heralds of The End''' (使徒強襲, ''Shito Kyōshū'', '''Apostle Assault''') is a [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]] collaboration stage added in [[Version 10.2 Update|version 10.2]], it features nearly all Neon Genesis Evangelion enemies.

==Overview==
===About===
Heralds of The End contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''WARNING Lvs''' (WARNING Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a WARNING can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Heralds of The End/WARNING Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Heralds of The End is unlocked after defeating all 4 Angels (the 4th, 6th, 9th & 10th Angel) at least once.

